## Summary

This PR implements the **IOPageDispatcher** for managing soft switch handlers in the $C000-$C0FF I/O page region of the Apple IIe emulator.

### New Files
- `SoftSwitchReadHandler.cs` - Delegate for soft switch read operations
- `SoftSwitchWriteHandler.cs` - Delegate for soft switch write operations  
- `IOPageDispatcher.cs` - Flat dispatch table with 256-entry arrays for read/write handlers
- `SlotIOHandlers.cs` - Handler arrays for slot card's 16-byte I/O region
- `IOPageDispatcherTests.cs` - Unit tests for dispatcher functionality
- `SlotIOHandlersTests.cs` - Unit tests for slot handlers

### Key Features
- Flat dispatch tables (256 entries each) for O(1) lookup performance
- `AggressiveInlining` on hot path `Read`/`Write` methods
- Read returns $FF (floating bus) for unregistered addresses
- Write is a no-op for unregistered addresses
- Slot handler installation/removal for peripheral cards at offsets $C080-$C0FF
- Comprehensive XML documentation matching project conventions
- `ReadHandlers`/`WriteHandlers` are internal to prevent bypassing `Set()` validation

